This product includes a Rust implementation of the classic Porter stemmer
derived from Apache OpenNLP, Copyright The Apache Software Foundation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Apache OpenNLP includes a Java adaptation of Martin Porter's Release 3
stemming algorithm.

The `hnsw` vector provider (src/hnsw/) is an independent Rust
implementation of the Hierarchical Navigable Small World graph described in
"Efficient and robust approximate nearest neighbor search using Hierarchical
Navigable Small World graphs" (Yu. A. Malkov and D. A. Yashunin,
arXiv:1603.09320): the layered insertion, the layer search, the neighbor
selection heuristic (applied to directions, see docs/hnsw.md) and the
query. No code from any HNSW implementation is included.
